{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. Approach object, grab it if possible, process it, move to destination, then do specific task or scan area. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Action ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObject    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToDestination    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectGrabbable    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectCarried    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    />",
